<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado have beheaded six Christians and a Catholic priest was killed one day after baptising 175 people, showing continued targeting of religious figures. Police killed three robbers at a microcredit service, while the United States deepened defence cooperation with Mozambique amid the insurgency and a renewed LNG-FSRU proposal aims to address South Africa's gas shortage. The conflict still caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1SdVpvLTl3Qi01N0RVTWxpRXZJdkg4ODlRa2NIRmZDWXlreTYzc3Fac3NMWTh2NFlwMS1POVlaTVVlUWVxbF9tUmI1OGxEQWdsektXdE1UQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5LelB3UTk1eWE5S1ozRzF3Sy0waVFIVVMyaHVvaDNNOVlkdlRBWHN4MzFEQ0E5cGs0dGx0eGZackpSNWRvcElGX2FHczR4UllDdzhfYmQtelF6T2tvSVp2SW4wMEFhNXJMVDdvOUZHZ1gtN292WUNfSzlVVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaama Press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxObVgyLUlWU0pQSUxvbzRvQWFFRFFFNlB3SnB4amFVN2NjQzBhZHgxdG1fWmZkalhIREdoNlRxNXh1enVrR3NScm9iblduc25INFBZUTlhT3FFcFJmZTR4MnQxbWs0dGhKZks2MC1OYkdTSkxhNEg5N3NIY2JzVjFTcGp6U2REbV85XzFfY3hrUkhJUVNuNmpUa2ZfTkY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Barnabas Aid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOV21CaGVZaHRTV2xGejBuUTVMUjFBN0FuNFBJRWkwWVE4aVFWYm5nRXBxU2pnXzNOWUR4MUt6d2JtQ3FTM2o4M1dkazRLb0djMFZPVE9GdWxtbWV6OUxSNjRfTDVGWURBbEk5enh3TjV3ekRtN0hfMlpmQXNpX2F0c3pUTkpUU2lnOEppYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOZ1hVa1BhbFphSHR5MUtQTFQwSnhmUk5ZT29nUGJFdHZwSUxfcWhIV2t2cmpwSWZSaGNucFlzQ19xSmZWVkZCVU9uVE91dDJoLWlVazVFQzZXTHV1Z2FTcTZFSkNFZFdKaXNfMzBHZjY4R0tZZG05RlZiNXFiMEd2aUR2TWtGbTFuT09OWm5ZMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mac